ents (self-host installers, Docker images, managed hosting = TODO), how a release is built (bump Implementation-Version in build.gradle, schema changelog, run Build Release with a version input), what is published where, smoke test in the workflow, rollback (TODO), who can deploy (TODO). Use uw-harness TODO blocks for unknowns."},{"id":"observability","status":"fail","evidence":["Logging: slf4j-jdk14, logger.* keys in config/Keys.java (console, file, level, rotate, fullStackTraces)","HealthResource.java: GET /api/health checks message rate and database","compose healthcheck uses /api/health; schedule/TaskHealthCheck.java","StatisticsResource / StatisticsManager"],"gap":"No observability doc; where production logs and alerts live is not visible.","plan":"Write docs/observability.md: logging config and default logs/ folder, /api/health semantics (web.healthCheck.dropThreshold), statistics API, TaskHealthCheck, web request log; TODO blocks for log storage, dashboards and alert channel of the managed service."},{"id":"skills","status":"fail","evidence":["No .agents/skills/ or .claude/skills/"],"gap":"No skills.","plan":"Create .agents/skills/implement-change, add-protocol-decoder (decoder + frame decoder + registration + *ProtocolDecoderTest with hex samples, run single test), debug-local (run with debug.xml, logger.fullStackTraces, H2 console, tools/test-integration.py / hex.sh to send sample messages), add-schema-change (new Liquibase changelog), and release (pointing to docs/deploy.md and its TODOs). Symlink .claude/skills to .agents/skills."}],"questions":[{"requirement":"deploy-explicit","question":"How is the managed hosting (traccar.org pricing) and the demo server deployed and updated: from the Docker images, installers, or another pipeline outside this repository?","why":"release.yml only publishes artifacts; production rollout is not visible."},{"requirement":"deploy-explicit","question":"Who is allowed to run the 'Build Release' workflow, and how is a bad rel