t` and document `git config core.hooksPath .githooks` in AGENTS.md and docs/local-dev.md (Gradle has no setup target to install it automatically)."},{"id":"local-env","status":"fail","evidence":["docker/compose/traccar-mysql.yaml and traccar-timescaledb.yaml exist but run the published traccar/traccar image, not the local build","debug.xml: H2 file database in ./target/database, so no external store is required","Main.java defaults to ./debug.xml when no argument is given","No Gradle run/dev task"],"gap":"The checker found no root compose file and no dev/run target; local run is a manual java -jar command.","plan":"Add a Gradle JavaExec task named `run` (mainClass org.traccar.Main, args debug.xml, dependsOn classes) in build.gradle without changing existing tasks; add a root compose.yaml with an optional MySQL or PostgreSQL service for testing other databases; write docs/local-dev.md (JDK 21, ./gradlew assemble, run with debug.xml, web UI on :8082 needs the traccar-web submodule, reset by deleting target/database*, logs on console, H2 console at /console)."},{"id":"env-example","status":"fail","evidence":["config/Config.java:48 reads CONFIG_USE_ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES; compose files use DATABASE_DRIVER, DATABASE_URL, DATABASE_USER, DATABASE_PASSWORD","No .env file tracked; compose files contain demo password 'traccar'"],"gap":"No .env.example documenting environment-variable configuration.","plan":"Create .env.example with CONFIG_USE_ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES=true, DATABASE_DRIVER=org.h2.Driver, DATABASE_URL=jdbc:h2:./target/database, DATABASE_USER=sa, DATABASE_PASSWORD= and a comment that any key in config/Keys.java maps to an upper-case env variable. Main configuration stays in debug.xml/traccar.xml."},{"id":"toolchain-pinned","status":"fail","evidence":["build.gradle: sourceCompatibility/targetCompatibility JavaVersion.VERSION_21, enforcer maxJdkVersion 21","gradle.yml uses Java 21; release.yml and Dockerfiles use JDK 25"],"gap":"Java version is set in build.gradle but